cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DL GIS Exchange in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DL GIS Exchange"
abstract: >-
  A Blender extension that moves terrain and map data between GIS and Blender in both directions: GeoTIFF terrain
  rasters and GIS vectors (shapefile, GeoPackage, GeoJSON) into Blender as meshes, and Blender geometry back out as
  georeferenced GeoTIFF rasters, including cut-and-fill difference rasters and solids. No GDAL needed.
authors:
